          856.0,
          818.0
        ],
        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "For example, the polyhydrazide from sebacyl chloride and sebacic dihydrazide, 0–10, showed a noticeable tendency to lose water of reaction and change, at least partially into a polyoxadiazole structure [eq. (2)] upon drying above 150°C. (N  $_{2}$ )."
